<section class="founder-home_wrap section-padding theme-dark-sand" data-figma-band="founder" data-band-top="4997.06">
  <div class="founder-home_layout site-grid">
    <h2 class="founder-home_title text-style-h2" data-figma="1:131">Meet the <em>founder</em>.</h2>
    <div class="founder-home_id">
      <span class="marker" data-figma="1:133" />
      <div class="founder-home_names stack">
        <p class="founder-home_label lead-marker text-style-label" data-figma="1:132">Dr Sarah Tranter</p>
        <p class="founder-home_role text-style-serif" data-figma="1:134">Founder &amp; Cosmetic Physician · 15+ years in practice</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="founder-home_bio text-style-main" data-figma="1:135">
      Dr Sarah Tranter founded the clinic on a simple premise: that treatment should follow judgement, not the other way around. Her approach considers the face as one system of structure and surface, not a list of isolated concerns. Every protocol at the clinic reflects standards she has set personally, whether or not she is the one delivering care.
    </p>
    <div class="founder-home_media media ratio-5-6" data-figma="1:130">
      <img src="/img/founder.jpg" alt="Dr Sarah Tranter, standing, arms folded" width="687" height="822" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  @layer components {
    .founder-home_layout {
      row-gap: var(--space-7);
    }
    .founder-home_title,
    .founder-home_id,
    .founder-home_bio,
    .founder-home_media {
      grid-column: margin / end;
    }
    .founder-home_id {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      & .marker {
        display: none;
      }
    }
    .founder-home_names {
      grid-column: margin / end;
    }
    .founder-home_role {
      max-width: 22.8ch;
    }
    .founder-home_bio {
      max-width: 53.5ch;
    }
    @media (width >= 48rem) {
      .founder-home_layout {
        row-gap: 0;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
      }
      .founder-home_title {
        grid-row: 1;
      }
      .founder-home_id {
        grid-row: 2;
        margin-top: calc(297 * var(--u));
        & .marker {
          display: block;
          margin-top: calc((max(var(--text-label-floor), var(--text-label)) * 0.721 - var(--marker)) / 2);
        }
      }
      .founder-home_names {
        grid-column: main / span 3;
      }
      .founder-home_bio {
        grid-row: 3;
        grid-column: marker / span 4;
        align-self: end;
      }
      .founder-home_media {
        grid-row: 1 / span 3;
        grid-column: half / span 5;
      }
    }
    @media (48rem <= width < 64rem) {
      .founder-home_names {
        grid-column: main / span 2;
      }
      .founder-home_bio {
        grid-column: marker / span 3;
      }
      .founder-home_media {
        grid-column: half / end;
      }
    }
    @media (width < 48rem) {
      .founder-home_label {
        --_lead-marker: inline-block;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
